{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49680","headline":"凤楼春 · 欧阳炯","name":"凤楼春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤髻绿云丛，深掩房栊。\n锦书通，梦中相见觉来慵。\n匀面泪，脸珠融。\n因想玉郎何处去，对淑景谁同。\n小楼中，春思无穷。\n倚阑凝望，闇牵愁绪，柳花飞起东风。\n斜日照帘，罗幌香冷粉屏空。\n海棠零落，莺语残红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}